WEBVTT

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.450
Teach us to pray,

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:17.990
just as John taught his disciples.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.260
When you pray, say,

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.970
Our Father in heaven,

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.700
Holy be Your name.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.490
Your kingdom come,

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.410
Your will be done on earth as it is in heaven.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.120
Give us day by day our daily bread.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.220
And forgive us our sins,

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.590
for we also forgive those who sin against us.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.820
And lead us not into temptation,

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:43.510
but deliver us from evil.

